(text "VOPT link + bypass DNP: no sensor power by default.\n3.3 V push-pull ABZ only; no differential receiver or 5 V conversion.\nExternal supply reference must be GND; do not backfeed this port." (at 223.52 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "a1fdb487-0465-53b6-85b2-603557a47bca"))
(text "ENCODER INTERFACE REVIEW\nThe five-pin connector is a provisional schematic assignment, not a frozen production connector.\nActual encoder model / output stage / cable length / pulse rate must be selected before PCB.\nA 5 V TTL, open-collector, RS-422 or other differential encoder needs an appropriate input stage.\nThe eight reserved sensor-power parts on the ABZ/SPI sheets are not enabled by merely fitting connectors." (at 20.32 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "b3ccfd6f-a772-52c6-a4c5-bf357656fc02"))
